 {"sec": "AML classification · p217", "page": 217, "q": "Which gene mutation is a favourable prognostic factor in AML?", "opts": ["NPM1", "TP53", "RUNX1", "FLT3-ITD"], "ans": 0, "exp": "Favourable genetics: inversion 16, t(8;21), CEBPA and NPM1 mutations. (Book p217)", "type": "mcq", "id": "PEDS-C47-104"},
