 {"sec": "AML clinical features and treatment · p217", "page": 217, "q": "In M3 (APML), the drug used is ATRA, which stands for ___.", "opts": ["Alpha-tocopherol retinoic acid", "All trans retinoic acid", "Anti-tumour retinoic antibody", "All trans retinoid analogue"], "ans": 1, "exp": "ATRA = all trans retinoic acid/tretinoin. (Book p217)", "type": "fill", "id": "PEDS-C47-121"},
