 {"sec": "Hodgkin staging and treatment · p218–219", "page": 218, "q": "Stage I of the modified Ann Arbor staging denotes —", "opts": ["Nodes above and below the diaphragm", "Nodes with organ involvement", "A single lymph node involved", "≥ 2 lymph nodes on one side of the diaphragm"], "ans": 2, "exp": "Stage I: single lymph node involved. (Book p218)", "type": "mcq", "id": "PEDS-C47-162"},
