 {"sec": "LCH features and spectrum · p220–221", "page": 220, "q": "The clinical spectrum of LCH can be —", "opts": ["Multisystemic", "Restricted to skin only", "Confined to bone only", "Confined to lymph nodes only"], "ans": 0, "exp": "LCH has a wide spectrum of disease and can be multisystemic. (Book p220)", "type": "mcq", "id": "PEDS-C47-208"},
 {"sec": "LCH features and spectrum · p220–221", "page": 220, "q": "The most common site of involvement in LCH is —", "opts": ["Lymph node", "Bone", "Skin", "Pituitary"], "ans": 1, "exp": "Sites involved: bone is the m/c, with skull > jaw. (Book p220)", "type": "mcq", "id": "PEDS-C47-209"},
